        <details>Images for SINV/EEEV:EEEV-143 Fab were collected on a Glacios electron microscope (Thermo Fisher Scientific) equipped with a K2 Summit Direct Electron Detector operated at 200 kV and having a nominal pixel size of 2.0 Å per pixel. Micrographs were acquired automatically using Leginon software. The total exposure time was 10 s and frames were recorded every 0.2 s. Defocus values ranged from 1.0 to 2.5 μm. The total accumulated does was ~25 e−/Å2. Deposited micrographs were motion corrected using MotionCor2.</details>
